{"id":"c838829b54","t":"The Rebel of the Tyrant Noble Family","c":"cv","n":46,"l":46,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family"},"u":1795477959452,"desc":"أقسم آش على استغلال والده بالتبني، عازماً على ردّ الجميل الذي تلقاه حين تيتم. لكن الحقيقة، التي أدركها أخيراً على حافة الموت، كانت شاملة. كل جهوده، إبداعاته… كل ما يستحقه… حتى القوة العظيمة التي وُلد بها، أجنحته السبعة… كل شيء سُلب منه! لذا… هل ننغمس في دوامة الانتقام المتوقعة، مُثقلين ميزان هذا المصير؟","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","بطل غير اعتيادي","تاريخى","دراما","فانتازيا","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-rebel-of-the-tyrant-noble-family|/manga/the-rebel-of-the-tyrant